{
  "name": "Shocker (OpenShock + PiShock)",
  "id": "shocker",
  "version": "2.1.1",
  "author": "community",
  "description": "Control OpenShock and PiShock from OSC-DreamChatbox. Live who on OpenShock. Optional event that temporarily replaces the whole chatbox when a shock happens.",
  "about": {
    "format": "markdown",
    "text": [
      "## Shocker plugin",
      "",
      "OpenShock + PiShock in one plugin. Placeholders use the **shocker** prefix.",
      "",
      "### Placeholders",
      "- `{shocker}` – status line (or event line while an event is active)",
      "- `{shocker_status}` – Connected / Offline / Error",
      "- `{shocker_last}` – last command (includes by Name when live)",
      "- `{shocker_intensity}` – last intensity",
      "- `{shocker_duration}` – last duration text",
      "- `{shocker_type}` – Shock / Vibrate / Sound / …",
      "- `{shocker_device}` – selected shocker name",
      "- `{shocker_by}` – who triggered it (OpenShock live)",
      "- `{shocker_event}` – event line only while an event is showing, else empty",
      "",
      "### Live event (replace chatbox)",
      "Enable **Replace chatbox on action**. When you (or someone else on OpenShock) trigger a command, the plugin temporarily replaces the **entire** chatbox text with your **Event template** for a few seconds, then returns to normal.",
      "",
      "Event template may use the same placeholders, e.g.",
      "`⚡ {shocker_type} {shocker_intensity}% by {shocker_by}`",
      "",
      "### Idle last-message timeout",
      "Under **Chatbox line (idle)** set **Last action stays for** (seconds).",
      "0 = forever. When the timer ends the last shock disappears from the normal status line.",
      "Independent of the replace-chatbox event."
    ]
  },
  "short_description": "OpenShock + PiShock control, live who, chatbox event flash",
  "tags": ["openshock", "pishock", "shock", "estim", "control", "hardware"],
  "Github": "https://github.com/ArcticTechy/OSC-DreamChatbox-OpenShock",
  "main": "main.py",
  "enabled": false,
  "api": 2,
  "min_app": "v1.3.2",
  "is_linux": true,
  "is_windows": true,
  "template": "{shocker}",
  "layout": ["settings", "chatbox"],
  "chatbox": {"enabled": true, "user_editable": true},
  "placeholders": {
    "status": "connection state",
    "last": "last control command",
    "intensity": "last intensity",
    "duration": "last duration text",
    "type": "Shock / Vibrate / Sound / Stop / Beep",
    "device": "selected shocker name",
    "by": "who triggered the last action",
    "event": "event line while a live event is showing"
  },
  "settings": [
    {
      "key": "intro",
      "type": "label",
      "label": "Shocker",
      "text": "OpenShock + PiShock. Set backend, credentials, then Refresh."
    },
    {
      "key": "backend",
      "type": "choice",
      "label": "Backend",
      "default": "openshock",
      "choices": [
        {"value": "openshock", "label": "OpenShock (openshock.app)"},
        {"value": "pishock", "label": "PiShock (pishock.com)"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "g_openshock",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "OpenShock",
      "open": true,
      "items": [
        {"key": "os_token", "type": "text", "label": "API Token", "default": "", "secret": true,
         "hint": "Open-Shock-Token from openshock.app → Settings → API Tokens"},
        {"key": "os_base_url", "type": "text", "label": "API Base URL", "default": "https://api.openshock.app",
         "hint": "Self-host only. No trailing slash."},
        {"key": "os_user_agent", "type": "text", "label": "User-Agent", "default": "OSC-DreamChatbox-Shocker/2.1"},
        {"key": "os_shocker_id", "type": "text", "label": "Shocker ID (UUID)", "default": ""},
        {"key": "os_watch_logs", "type": "bool", "label": "Watch live logs (show who)", "default": true,
         "hint": "Poll logs so website / other apps show up with the username."},
        {"key": "os_poll_secs", "type": "int", "label": "Log poll interval", "default": 6, "min": 3, "max": 60, "suffix": " s"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "g_pishock",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "PiShock",
      "open": false,
      "items": [
        {"key": "ps_username", "type": "text", "label": "Username", "default": ""},
        {"key": "ps_apikey", "type": "text", "label": "API Key", "default": "", "secret": true},
        {"key": "ps_sharecode", "type": "text", "label": "Share Code", "default": ""},
        {"key": "ps_log_name", "type": "text", "label": "Log name", "default": "OSC-DreamChatbox"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "g_event",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "Live event (replace chatbox)",
      "open": true,
      "items": [
        {"key": "event_enabled", "type": "bool", "label": "Replace chatbox on action", "default": true},
        {"key": "event_template", "type": "text", "label": "Event template",
         "default": "⚡ {shocker_type} {shocker_intensity}% {shocker_duration} by {shocker_by}"},
        {"key": "event_seconds", "type": "int", "label": "Show for", "default": 4, "min": 1, "max": 30, "suffix": " s"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "g_common",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "Defaults & status",
      "open": true,
      "items": [
        {"key": "status_label", "type": "label", "label": "Status", "default": "not configured"},
        {"key": "btn_refresh", "type": "action", "label": "Refresh"},
        {"key": "intensity", "type": "slider", "label": "Intensity", "default": 30, "min": 1, "max": 100},
        {"key": "duration_ms", "type": "int", "label": "Duration (OpenShock)", "default": 1000, "min": 300, "max": 65535, "suffix": " ms"},
        {"key": "duration_sec", "type": "int", "label": "Duration (PiShock)", "default": 1, "min": 1, "max": 15, "suffix": " s"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "g_actions",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "Actions",
      "open": true,
      "items": [
        {"key": "btn_vibrate", "type": "action", "label": "Vibrate"},
        {"key": "btn_shock", "type": "action", "label": "Shock"},
        {"key": "btn_sound", "type": "action", "label": "Sound / Beep"},
        {"key": "btn_stop", "type": "action", "label": "Stop (OpenShock)"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "g_chatbox",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "Chatbox line (idle)",
      "open": true,
      "items": [
        {"key": "show_when_offline", "type": "bool", "label": "Show line even when offline", "default": false},
        {"key": "prefix", "type": "text", "label": "Prefix", "default": "⚡"},
        {"key": "last_ttl", "type": "int", "label": "Last action stays for", "default": 0, "min": 0, "max": 300, "suffix": " s",
         "hint": "0 = forever. How long the last shock stays on the normal status line (when not using / after the replace-event)."}
      ]
    }
  ]
}
